{"id":"torrey:magistrates","source":"torrey","name":"Magistrates","slug":"magistrates","seeAlso":[],"entries":[{"text":"Are appointed by God — Ro 13:1.","refs":[["Rom",13,1,13,1]]},{"text":"Are ministers of God — Ro 13:4,6.","refs":[["Rom",13,4,13,4],["Rom",13,6,13,6]]},{"text":"Purpose of their appointment — Ro 13:4; 1Pe 2:14.","refs":[["Rom",13,4,13,4],["1Pet",2,14,2,14]]},{"text":"Their office to be respected — Ac 23:5.","refs":[["Acts",23,5,23,5]]},{"text":"Are not a terror to the good, but to the evil — Ro 13:3.","refs":[["Rom",13,3,13,3]]},{"text":"To be wisely selected and appointed — Ex 18:21; Ezr 7:25.","refs":[["Exod",18,21,18,21],["Ezra",7,25,7,25]]},{"text":"To be prayed for — 1Ti 2:1,2.","refs":[["1Tim",2,1,2,1],["1Tim",2,2,2,2]]},{"text":"Seek wisdom from God. — 1Ki 3:9.","refs":[["1Kgs",3,9,3,9]]},{"text":"Rule in the fear of God. — 2Sa 23:3; 2Ch 19:7.","refs":[["2Sam",23,3,23,3],["2Chr",19,7,19,7]]},{"text":"Know the law of God. — Ezr 7:25.","refs":[["Ezra",7,25,7,25]]},{"text":"Be faithful to the Sovereign. — Da 6:4.","refs":[["Dan",6,4,6,4]]},{"text":"Enforce the laws. — Ezr 7:26.","refs":[["Ezra",7,26,7,26]]},{"text":"Judge wisely. — 1Ki 3:16-28.","refs":[["1Kgs",3,16,3,28]]},{"text":"Hate covetousness. — Ex 18:21.","refs":[["Exod",18,21,18,21]]},{"text":"Not take bribes. — Ex 23:8; De 16:19.","refs":[["Exod",23,8,23,8],["Deut",16,19,16,19]]},{"text":"Defend the poor. — Job 29:12,16.","refs":[["Job",29,12,29,12],["Job",29,16,29,16]]},{"text":"Judge for God, not for man. — 2Ch 19:6.","refs":[["2Chr",19,6,19,6]]},{"text":"Judge righteously. — De 1:16; 16:18; 25:1.","refs":[["Deut",1,16,1,16],["Deut",16,18,16,18],["Deut",25,1,25,1]]},{"text":"Be impartial. — Ex 23:6; De 1:17.","refs":[["Exod",23,6,23,6],["Deut",1,17,1,17]]},{"text":"Be diligent in ruling. — Ro 12:8.","refs":[["Rom",12,8,12,8]]},{"text":"Subjection to their authority enjoined. — Mt 23:2,3; Ro 13:1; 1Pe 2:13,14.","refs":[["Matt",23,2,23,2],["Matt",23,3,23,3],["Rom",13,1,13,1],["1Pet",2